## Remove duplicates (`$group`)

```
{
  "aggregate": [
    // …
    {
      "$group": {
        "_id": "$vendorRegNo",
        "__tmpRoot": {
          "$first": "$$ROOT"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "$replaceRoot": {
        "newRoot": "$__tmpRoot"
      }
    },
    // …
    {
      "$sort": {
        "__searchScore": -1 // it is important to sort the results correctly after using $group
      }
    }
  ]
}
