| --- | --- |
| EU1 Ireland | [https://elis.rossum.ai/svc/netsuite-v3/api/v1/export](https://elis.rossum.ai/svc/netsuite-v3/api/v1/export) |
| EU2 Frankfurt | [https://shared-eu2.rossum.app/svc/netsuite-v3/api/v1/export](https://shared-eu2.rossum.app/svc/netsuite-v3/api/v1/export) |
